        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "雷蛇",
        "content": "能天使小姐，我可不可以理解成，你已经摸清了敌人的分布？"
    },
    {
        "id": 86,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_103_angel_1\", name2=\"char_107_liskam_1\", focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
